{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"19":"Shares of Inheritance (Kitab Al-Fara'id)"},"section_detail":{"19":{"hadithnumber_first":2885,"hadithnumber_last":2927,"arabicnumber_first":2885,"arabicnumber_last":2927,"name_native":"كتاب الفرائض"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2888,"arabicnumber":2888,"text":"حدثنا مسلم بن ابراهيم، حدثنا شعبة، عن ابي اسحاق، عن البراء بن عازب، قال اخر اية نزلت في الكلالة { يستفتونك قل الله يفتيكم في الكلالة}","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (4605) Sahih Muslim (1618)"}],"reference":{"book":19,"hadith":4}}]}